{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">山西小伙牛立明</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">在西藏高原戍边值守过九年</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">曾荣获二等功一次、三等功三次</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">退伍返乡后他加入京东物流</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">参与保障了</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">冬季国际体育赛事的物流服务</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">又主动报名援沪</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">入职16个月</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">他被提拔为站长</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">他的目标是带着兄弟们</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">一起踏实干、多创收</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">从戍边到揽派</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">他每一次任务都全力以赴</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JtJOgGJTUTsvLeGXcYFu6g\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1690885128633.jpg\" /></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">据不完全统计</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">京东集团有数千名退伍军人</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">他们退伍不褪色</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">在新的岗位上续写着初心</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">京东为他们拓宽就业渠道</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">规划职业发展通道</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">打造专业能力学习体系</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">组织技能培训</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">帮助他们提升业务能力</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">推动退役军人实现高质量就业</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">这不仅仅是军人本色的光辉</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">更是服务人民最好的写照</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">他们在新的岗位上</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">继续书写着责任与担当</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">八一建军节</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">致敬最可爱的人</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>", "contentAbstract": "致敬最可爱的人", "contentCode": "content01315", "contentTitle": "“做事的人身上有光！”", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1690884975000, "id": 3232, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1690885154875.jpg", "updateTime": 1690885295000}}